""}}},"misidentified":{}},"acBonus":2,"grade":null,"runes":{"reinforcing":0},"specific":null,"speedPenalty":0,"subitems":[]},"type":"shield","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Yr9yCuJiAlFh3QEB","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"VMwcx8UrDmVppLN3"},{"type":"action","name":"Dissolve in Darkness","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>When a lightling is hit by an attack roll from or fails a saving throw against a darkness or shadow effect, they take @Damage[2d6[spirit]] damage in addition to the normal effects. They also take @Damage[2d6[spirit]] damage whenever they begin their turn in an area of dim light or darkness.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"ygXsIhuSdIUF1LrP","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Lantern Keeper","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Any lantern held by a lightling is magically empowered by the lightling's elemental essence, allowing it to be used as a shield that grants a +2 circumstance bonus to AC when the lightling Raises a Shield (Hardness 5, HP 30, BT 15). The lantern sheds magical bright light out to 60 feet and dim light for a further 60 feet beyond that. If the lantern is broken, the radius decreases to 15 feet of bright light and 15 feet of dim light. The lantern's light can be counteracted with an air, cold, darkness, shadow, or water effect (counteract DC 22), or snuffed out with a single successful @Check[thievery|dc:25] check to Disable a Device. Either method extinguishes the lantern until the lightling relights the lantern with an Interact action.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fire","light","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"bA2KNnnuQ1CaZEaR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Shield Block (Special)","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>If the lightling uses a burning lantern to Shield Block an attack from an adjacent creature, that creature must succeed on a @Check[fortitude|dc:19] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round; this secondary effect has the light, occult, and visual traits.</p><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ShieldBlock]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"shield-block","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"deathNote":false},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.m4HQ2o5aPxjXf2kY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"iCJVFcqlrNdXCFJA"},{"img":"icons/sundries/lights/lantern-iron-yellow.webp","name":"Lantern (Hooded)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A lantern sheds bright light and requires 1 pint of oil to function for 6 hours. A hooded lantern sheds light in a 30-foot radius (and dim light in the next 30 feet) and is equipped with shutters, which you can close to block the light. Closing or opening the shutters takes an Interact action.</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"TokenLight","predicate":["active-lantern"],"value":{"animation":{"intensity":4,"speed":1,"type":"torch"},"bright":30,"color":"#975335","dim":60,"shadows":0.2}},{"key":"TokenEffectIcon","predicate":["active-lantern"],"value":"icons/sundries/lights/lantern-iron-yellow.webp"},{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.LitItem","option":"active-lantern","toggleable":true}],"slug":"lantern-hooded","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":0},"quantity":1,"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"sp":7}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"containerId":null,"size":"med","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"","img":"","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"subitems":[]},"type":"equipment","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.dIRZ0LL7G31fJNYz","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"3FJOO2ttBexAMyyD"},{"img":"icons/tools/smith